{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38333","headline":"和峡州冯使君题所居 · 吴融","name":"和峡州冯使君题所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三年拔薤成仁政，一日诛茅葺所居。\n晓岫近排吟阁冷，夜江遥响寝堂虚。\n唯怀避地逃多难，不羡朝天卧直庐。\n记得街西邻舍否，投荒南去五千余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}